WEBVTT

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.450
<i>The rank-advancement exam:</i>

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:12.810
<i>a special event held by the school 
to determine the students' ranks.</i>

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:16.240
<i>It is the duty of all the students 
of the demon school Babyls</i>

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:18.660
<i>to advance their ranks through this exam.</i>

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:22.500
<i>The first-years get seven chances 
to raise their ranks:</i>

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:25.870
<i>the summoning ritual, the flying race,</i>

00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:29.250
<i>execution cannonball, the Battler Party,</i>

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:32.770
<i>the end-of-terminus exams, 
and in addition to these...</i>

00:00:32.770 --> 00:00:36.290
<i>the first-years' final battle, 
the Harvest Festival,</i>

00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:40.210
<i>and the last chance for them to show 
off their appeal, the Music Festival.</i>

00:00:40.210 --> 00:00:43.880
<i>In these two events where 
the students shine the most,</i>

00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:48.640
<i>the Misfit Class students will strive 
to climb to the rank of Dalet.</i>

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:51.150
<i>If they don't all reach this rank...</i>

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:56.620
If you fail this order, you will immediately
 be ejected from the Royal One!

00:00:56.620 --> 00:00:59.030
<i>In order to get through this trial,</i>

00:00:59.030 --> 00:01:05.360
<i>the students of the Misfit Class 
began training with tutors.</i>

00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:40.510
<b>Master Bachiko</b>

00:02:36.950 --> 00:02:38.670
"Master Bachiko."

00:02:44.050 --> 00:02:45.670
No entry!

00:02:45.670 --> 00:02:47.680
<b>Guest Staff Room</b>

00:02:47.860 --> 00:02:50.440
Sniffle, sniffle, sniffle...

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:55.170
I can't believe she's working me to the bone 
while I'm wearing this frilly, fluffy outfit.

00:02:55.170 --> 00:02:57.160
N-Now, now...

00:02:57.160 --> 00:02:59.940
Don't worry about it. 
Let's do our best, Lead-kun.

00:02:59.940 --> 00:03:02.370
Iruma-kun, you really do seem used to this.

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:03.030
Huh?!

00:03:03.030 --> 00:03:05.070
Frilly and fluffy.

00:03:05.070 --> 00:03:07.080
Th-That's not true...

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:08.120
Really?

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:09.580
Y-Yes, really.

00:03:09.970 --> 00:03:13.760
Hey, Iruminati-chan and Lindy-chan.

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:16.370
Quit yer yappin' and get to workin'.

00:03:16.370 --> 00:03:17.930
Y-Yes, ma'am.

00:03:17.930 --> 00:03:20.320
Lindy-chan? Me?!

00:03:20.320 --> 00:03:25.020
Next, I think I'd like to eat some homemade 
sweets made by my precious little minions.

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:29.630
I'll get all the ingredients ready for you, 
so snap to it and chop chop.

00:03:29.990 --> 00:03:31.770
Snap to it and...

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:33.060
...chop chop?

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:35.380
Snap to it and...

00:03:35.380 --> 00:03:36.910
...chop chop?!

00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:44.080
<i>The Fruity Ground Dragon.</i>

00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:48.040
<b>Fruity 
Ground 
Dragon</b>

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:48.400
The strawberries growing on its head 
are super sweet and delicious!

00:03:54.190 --> 00:03:56.520
W-We somehow got them...

00:03:57.440 --> 00:03:59.220
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:03:59.440 --> 00:04:01.840
Hey, took you long enough.

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:04.850
So long that I now feel 
like eating meat instead.

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:06.440
Burp.

00:04:06.440 --> 00:04:07.970
I don't need those anymore.

00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:12.930
Anyway, you two can go home now.

00:04:13.270 --> 00:04:16.440
Man, I'm stuffed.

00:04:16.870 --> 00:04:18.700
Training!

00:04:19.130 --> 00:04:21.690
Welcome home, Iruma-sama.

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:23.260
Hey, thanks.

00:04:23.260 --> 00:04:25.480
Welcome home, Iruma-kun!

00:04:25.480 --> 00:04:27.200
Did you have another fun day?

00:04:27.480 --> 00:04:28.150
Yup.

00:04:29.840 --> 00:04:32.790
You fools! I told you 
I wanted Ultra Sweet today!

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:36.000
<b>Super Sweet</b>

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:36.000
<i>Super Sweet is not Ultra Sweet.</i>

00:04:36.480 --> 00:04:38.760
Welcome home, Iruma-sama.

00:04:38.760 --> 00:04:41.030
Oh. Hey, thanks.

00:04:41.030 --> 00:04:43.180
Welcome home, Iruma-kun!

00:04:43.180 --> 00:04:46.250
I've been waiting all day for you!

00:04:46.490 --> 00:04:47.230
Yup.

00:04:54.130 --> 00:04:56.930
You gotta do it harder, 
or it's not gonna do any good!

00:04:56.930 --> 00:04:58.590
S-Sorry.

00:04:58.590 --> 00:05:00.020
For cryin' out loud...

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:02.240
Cuckoo. Cuckoo.

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:05.110
Oh, look at the time.

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:07.160
Okay, you guys can go home now.

00:05:07.790 --> 00:05:10.280
"You guys can go home," my ass!

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:12.910
Day in, day out, she's just 
making selfish demands!

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:15.290
This has nothing to do 
with advancing our ranks!

00:05:15.670 --> 00:05:18.560
We're just errand boys! I'm done with this!

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:24.290
I'll still be worried, but I'm gonna 
ask Robin-sensei to tutor me.

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:26.620
You should come with me, Iruma-kun. Yeah?

00:05:26.620 --> 00:05:29.390
Um... I'm okay here for a bit longer.

00:05:29.390 --> 00:05:30.820
What? Why, though?

00:05:30.820 --> 00:05:35.430
Well... I'm used to things being unfair.

00:05:35.740 --> 00:05:40.410
And I think maybe Master Bachiko 
has some kind of plan,

00:05:40.410 --> 00:05:43.560
so I think I'll be okay 
with her a little longer.

00:05:44.430 --> 00:05:46.160
That can't be good for your health.

00:05:46.160 --> 00:05:48.110
Nah, I'll be fine!

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:53.680
In that case, I'm gonna head 
over to Robin-sensei.

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:55.670
You should come, too, 
when you feel like it.

00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:57.670
Sure, thanks!

00:06:12.320 --> 00:06:13.070
Hey.

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:16.220
Master! I'm sorry! I'll get these 
up to dry immediately!

00:06:16.220 --> 00:06:18.900
To be honest, I'm surprised.

00:06:19.740 --> 00:06:21.410
It's quite impressive.

00:06:21.410 --> 00:06:26.240
No one's lasted this long 
dealing with my orders.

00:06:26.520 --> 00:06:30.000
That willpower you possess when
 it comes to helping others out...

00:06:30.620 --> 00:06:32.040
Your drive to take action...

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:34.870
You know, you're really...

00:06:37.760 --> 00:06:40.410
the biggest moron I've ever met.

00:06:53.980 --> 00:06:56.390
Welcome home, Iruma-sama.

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:57.250
Mm.

00:06:58.360 --> 00:06:59.410
Iruma-sama?

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:03.400
Welcome home, Iruma-kun! Let's eat!

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:05.620
Make sure you have plenty to eat, Iruma-kun!

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:05.780
Your Hell Grey tea.

00:07:05.620 --> 00:07:08.500
And eat tomorrow's dinner's 
worth in the morning.

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:11.330
And tomorrow night, eat the 
next day's breakfast's worth.

00:07:11.330 --> 00:07:12.280
And two mornings from now...

00:07:19.190 --> 00:07:21.080
<i>Huh? That's strange.</i>

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:26.630
You idiot! Dumbass! Moron! 
Pfft, you're too slow!

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:26.200
<i>Master's face just won't leave my mind.</i>

00:07:26.850 --> 00:07:30.940
<i>My chest feels really tight, and it feels 
like there's something in my throat.</i>

00:07:31.870 --> 00:07:34.670
<i>For some reason, I feel...</i>

00:07:34.670 --> 00:07:37.440
...the biggest moron I've ever met.

00:07:37.440 --> 00:07:39.050
<i>I feel...</i>

00:07:39.280 --> 00:07:41.410
<i>insanely frustrated!</i>

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:44.760
<i>I'm so insanely frustrated...</i>

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:47.810
<i>that I can't sleep!</i>

00:07:49.770 --> 00:07:52.900
Iruma-sama! How glorious 
it is to have you call me!

00:07:52.900 --> 00:07:54.240
Is something the matter?

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:56.540
S-Sorry for calling so late.

00:07:56.540 --> 00:07:58.200
Oh, it's perfectly fine!

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:00.050
I'm still in the middle of training.

00:08:00.050 --> 00:08:02.040
Wait, this late?!

00:08:02.570 --> 00:08:08.160
It's an assignment from Balam-sensei, 
and it's an impossible amount of work...

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:13.420
So I feel... incredibly motivated!

00:08:13.420 --> 00:08:15.600
I-I see.

00:08:15.600 --> 00:08:17.480
Sorry to bother you, Azz-kun.

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:18.260
Do your best.

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:20.640
Thank you! I shall!

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:24.340
<i>I want to show you how much
 I've grown as soon as possible!</i>

00:08:24.340 --> 00:08:27.770
<i>Please feel free to contact me 
at any time! Goodnight!</i>

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:32.070
<i>The girls' meeting is starting now.</i>

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:35.600
<i>Girls' meeting?</i>

00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:38.590
<i>I guess Clara's training this late, too.</i>

00:08:39.600 --> 00:08:40.790
<i>I see.</i>

00:08:41.300 --> 00:08:43.800
<i>Everyone's working hard.</i>

00:08:44.810 --> 00:08:48.450
<i>I can't just let her call me 
a moron like that.</i>

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:52.310
<i>Which means I need to...</i>

00:08:52.310 --> 00:08:54.720
Moron, moron.

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:57.500
<i>I won't just be a moron 
who only does what he's told.</i>

00:09:02.690 --> 00:09:03.720
Huh?

00:09:04.110 --> 00:09:05.690
I will willingly...

00:09:06.260 --> 00:09:09.390
become the most perfect errand boy!

00:09:09.390 --> 00:09:11.060
It is an honor to serve you!

00:09:11.060 --> 00:09:12.680
Now, Master! Have some tea!

00:09:12.680 --> 00:09:14.600
How did you come to this conclusion?

00:09:14.600 --> 00:09:16.200
Wait, you're laughing?

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:23.950
<i>Will this perfect errand boy be 
able to reach the Dalet rank?</i>

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:32.360
<b>Sure</b>

00:09:33.990 --> 00:09:37.100
After school...

00:09:37.390 --> 00:09:39.480
This concludes our lessons for the day.

00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:43.360
Make sure you don't forget your 
homework for each class.

00:09:44.220 --> 00:09:47.730
Now, all of you, head to your training.

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:49.900
You do understand, don't you?

00:09:49.900 --> 00:09:53.570
If you do not advance to Dalet, 
you will be thrown out of the Royal One.

00:09:53.870 --> 00:09:55.960
Enjoy your struggles.

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:12.710
These are statements from the actual parties involved.

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:12.920
<i>These are statements from
 the actual parties involved.</i>

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:16.000
Come on, let's be honest here.

00:10:16.280 --> 00:10:18.360
I know we're all curious.

00:10:18.360 --> 00:10:20.700
It's been two weeks since 
we met these tutors.

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:25.990
Just what kind of horrifying training 
has everyone else been going through?

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:29.020
<b><i>The Horror!!</i></b>

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:29.020
<b><i>Truly Horrifying Training</i></b>

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:29.020
<b><i>That Actually Happened!!</i></b>

00:10:29.020 --> 00:10:30.400
Let's start...

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:32.510
with the two who are dripping wet!

00:10:32.510 --> 00:10:34.400
Thank you for noticing!

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:39.930
It's truly horrifying 
just thinking back on it.

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:45.570
Master Vepar said that she wants 
to strengthen our bloodline abilities...

00:10:51.020 --> 00:10:54.310
Your bloodline abilities are truly powerful,

00:10:54.310 --> 00:10:56.720
but that's only on the surface.

00:10:57.180 --> 00:10:59.360
Making you unable to use 
your bloodline abilities

00:10:59.360 --> 00:11:02.100
and then making you get them back...

00:11:02.100 --> 00:11:05.130
That is the training I've thought of.

00:11:05.130 --> 00:11:06.890
And that's why...

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:09.770
you'll be spending some time underwater.

00:11:13.820 --> 00:11:15.440
Wait, that's just torture!

00:11:16.390 --> 00:11:21.410
And that's why Agares-dono has been 
sleeping constantly when not training.

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:23.950
Yikes! But he's always asleep!

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:27.700
Day after day, we're spending
our time in the water.

00:11:32.340 --> 00:11:34.680
I'm sorta in the same boat.

00:11:35.080 --> 00:11:38.680
Robin-sensei asked me to
 bring him my favorite things,

00:11:38.680 --> 00:11:41.210
so I brought him all of my games and...

00:11:41.380 --> 00:11:44.220
Okay, let's beat them all in six days.

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:49.960
Huh?

00:11:49.960 --> 00:11:52.590
This is training to 
increase your concentration!

00:11:52.590 --> 00:11:54.750
You'll be playing the ones 
you've already beaten, too.

00:11:54.750 --> 00:11:56.950
I mean... I do like video games...

00:11:56.950 --> 00:11:58.480
I'll be playing, too.

00:11:58.970 --> 00:12:00.080
Let's take a break.

00:12:00.080 --> 00:12:02.110
Not yet. Put your back into it!

00:12:02.650 --> 00:12:04.400
Um, it's morning...

00:12:04.400 --> 00:12:06.800
Okay, we can continue tomorrow.

00:12:06.800 --> 00:12:09.120
Make sure you go to your usual classes.

00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:09.960
Bye now!

00:12:11.510 --> 00:12:13.030
You're friggin' bugging out my brain!

00:12:13.030 --> 00:12:16.210
And "tomorrow" isn't tomorrow 
anymore when it's morning already!

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:17.400
Oh...

00:12:17.400 --> 00:12:18.840
But that's your training, isn't it?

00:12:18.840 --> 00:12:19.790
There's gotta be limits!

00:12:19.790 --> 00:12:21.960
I can't be out until the sun rises every night!

00:12:21.960 --> 00:12:23.850
Ugh!

00:12:26.440 --> 00:12:29.420
We haven't even gone home yet.

00:12:30.760 --> 00:12:31.660
Huh?

00:12:31.660 --> 00:12:34.820
We can't go home until we get one hit in.

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:43.360
You've still got a ways to go.

00:12:44.600 --> 00:12:45.610
You're mine!

00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:51.400
Curses...

00:12:51.400 --> 00:12:53.250
You're completely obvious.

00:12:55.680 --> 00:12:58.440
He does actually retaliate, 
so we've been getting roughed up.

00:12:58.440 --> 00:13:01.260
We're constantly training other 
than when we're in our classes.

00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:03.840
Simple yet terrifying...

00:13:05.390 --> 00:13:09.100
Um, speaking of not being 
able to go home, two of us...

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:11.990
Jazz-dono and Allocer-dono are not here.

00:13:11.990 --> 00:13:13.840
Yeah, about that...

00:13:14.180 --> 00:13:17.350
I sent a message asking 
how training's going.

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:27.160
He took us somewhere amazing! 
Sergeant Furfur seems like
 such an awesome adult!

00:13:17.840 --> 00:13:20.520
At first, it sounded like 
they were having fun.

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:23.370
"He took us somewhere amazing!

00:13:23.370 --> 00:13:26.580
Sergeant Furfur seems like 
such an awesome adult!"

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:33.700
Huh...? Uh... Hm? 
Something's going on...

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:29.520
But the messages gradually 
got shorter and shorter...

00:13:29.520 --> 00:13:33.320
"Huh? Uh... Hm? Something's going on."

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:37.540
Lead, could you come over here?

00:13:33.690 --> 00:13:36.440
"Lead, could you come over here?"

00:13:37.640 --> 00:13:40.370
The last reply I got was...

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:43.630
<b>CRAP</b>

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:43.630
<b>HELP U—</b>

00:13:49.380 --> 00:13:51.060
Okay, next.

00:13:52.770 --> 00:13:56.200
Oh, how about you two, 
Clara-dono and Eliza-dono?!

00:13:58.030 --> 00:14:00.410
Um... What are those poses?

00:14:00.410 --> 00:14:02.970
I did see you guys doing 
those in class, but...

00:14:02.970 --> 00:14:04.910
We're practicing making 
you keep your eyes on us!

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:13.840
The important thing is 
to control their eyes.

00:14:15.840 --> 00:14:19.080
Women improve the more they're looked at.

00:14:19.340 --> 00:14:20.790
And that's why

00:14:20.790 --> 00:14:23.540
we must always strike beautiful poses!

00:14:23.540 --> 00:14:24.800
Yes!

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:26.930
It is extremely brutal!

00:14:28.870 --> 00:14:31.340
So, what happened to you?

00:14:31.620 --> 00:14:33.440
Allow me to explain in her stead.

00:14:33.440 --> 00:14:36.610
As summoners, we were
 told it'd be best to be in

00:14:36.610 --> 00:14:39.230
the same environment as the 
beasts we communicate with.

00:14:40.240 --> 00:14:44.730
No! It stinks! It's gross! Let me out!

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:50.990
Spending the whole day in 
a cage with a wild beast...

00:14:52.960 --> 00:14:54.910
It was just so filthy.

00:14:54.910 --> 00:14:56.340
Truly!

00:14:56.340 --> 00:14:58.690
I want to get closer to Lady Keroli!

00:14:58.690 --> 00:15:01.800
Not some smelly beast! 
So why was I put in a different cage?!

00:15:01.800 --> 00:15:03.500
You never change, do you?

00:15:04.790 --> 00:15:07.560
Now, you're the only one left, Iruma-sama!

00:15:07.960 --> 00:15:10.480
What kind of training have you been doing?!

00:15:10.480 --> 00:15:11.890
Waterfall meditation, 
waterfall meditation?!

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:13.330
Waterstand meditation,
 waterjump meditation?!

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:14.800
Well, I...

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:21.060
First, I have to boil water.

00:15:24.810 --> 00:15:25.800
And then...

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:29.160
I prepare my master's breakfast and tea...

00:15:26.830 --> 00:15:27.870
Not bad.

00:15:27.870 --> 00:15:29.150
Yes, ma'am!

00:15:29.670 --> 00:15:32.680
Then, sometimes, I go 
clothes shopping with her...

00:15:30.300 --> 00:15:31.730
How about this one?

00:15:31.730 --> 00:15:33.470
Not bad.

00:15:33.470 --> 00:15:36.830
Then we have a discussion over sweets.

00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:35.860
Hm... That's very deep.

00:15:35.860 --> 00:15:36.830
Right?

00:15:37.600 --> 00:15:39.150
I dry her futons,

00:15:39.150 --> 00:15:41.200
do her laundry, draw her bath,

00:15:41.200 --> 00:15:43.070
prepare her dinner, and then go home.

00:15:43.070 --> 00:15:45.750
That's basically how my 
training's been going every day!

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:47.590
That's not training.

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:48.290
Wait, what?

00:15:48.290 --> 00:15:51.560
B-But Master is slowly 
starting to acknowledge me...

00:15:51.560 --> 00:15:53.050
You're basically her servant.

00:15:53.480 --> 00:15:57.500
She can just say "this" or "that," 
and I can understand what she wants.

00:15:57.500 --> 00:16:00.290
Oh, Iruma-chi is being bullied...

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:03.760
Are you all right?! Should 
I report this to Lord Kalego?!

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:07.760
I guess we've all got it rough.

00:16:07.760 --> 00:16:09.980
There is no end in sight right now.

00:16:09.980 --> 00:16:11.690
Maybe they're just messing with us...

00:16:11.690 --> 00:16:13.480
I just want to relax.

00:16:13.480 --> 00:16:15.300
I would like to sleep.

00:16:15.300 --> 00:16:17.890
We still don't even know 
the point of this training.

00:16:17.890 --> 00:16:20.410
Truly, I am quite done with this.

00:16:21.730 --> 00:16:23.170
Assemble!

00:16:23.840 --> 00:16:25.270
Roger!

00:16:27.640 --> 00:16:29.520
What? Are all of you going?

00:16:29.520 --> 00:16:30.720
Well...

00:16:30.720 --> 00:16:33.000
I really don't wanna get kicked out.

00:16:33.360 --> 00:16:34.400
Not to mention,

00:16:34.400 --> 00:16:37.520
the last thing I wanna do is lose 
to adults being so unreasonable.

00:16:37.990 --> 00:16:41.020
We are the Misfit Class, after all.

00:16:41.280 --> 00:16:42.410
<i>Everyone...</i>

00:16:42.920 --> 00:16:44.020
Iruma-chi!

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:47.790
Fall for me!

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:56.160
<i>Everyone's serious about 
reaching Dalet rank.</i>

00:16:57.520 --> 00:16:59.470
<i>I need to train hard, too,</i>

00:17:00.110 --> 00:17:03.230
<i>so that all of us can protect the Royal One.</i>

00:17:06.240 --> 00:17:08.560
Damn it, he's late.

00:17:08.560 --> 00:17:10.710
It's long past sweets time.

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:12.960
Is he still in class?

00:17:12.960 --> 00:17:15.590
Aw, I've spotted a Bachiko-chan!

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:20.600
It's been a while! You really did come!

00:17:20.930 --> 00:17:22.350
Have you been well?

00:17:26.150 --> 00:17:28.240
Y-Yes...

00:17:28.500 --> 00:17:29.930
I see.

00:17:29.930 --> 00:17:32.840
Thank you for responding 
to such an abrupt summons.

00:17:32.840 --> 00:17:34.280
Oh, it's nothing.

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:37.530
Well, you are quite strong. I'm very happy.

00:17:38.920 --> 00:17:41.610
A-Anything for you, Sullivan-sama.

00:17:41.890 --> 00:17:45.180
It seems like you're getting 
along well with Iruma-kun, too.

00:17:45.180 --> 00:17:49.120
I hope you'll continue helping 
Iruma-kun with his training.

00:17:55.570 --> 00:17:57.320
Oh, it's from Master Bachiko.

00:17:57.320 --> 00:17:58.300
Let's see...

00:17:58.600 --> 00:18:01.020
Food shopping, laundry, and...

00:18:01.370 --> 00:18:03.600
creating a new weapon?

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:05.770
A new weapon?

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:06.590
Yup!

00:18:06.590 --> 00:18:08.290
We'll be making one for your training.

00:18:08.290 --> 00:18:09.270
Master?!

00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:12.980
A brand new weapon for you.

00:18:15.760 --> 00:18:16.910
A weapon...

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:23.740
<b>Babyls Highlands Point 13</b>

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:23.740
Alrighty then. We're gonna start training.

00:18:23.740 --> 00:18:25.740
Um...

00:18:25.990 --> 00:18:28.620
What do you mean by "Alrighty then"?

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:35.480
I was enjoying the good life so much 
that I forgot about your training.

00:18:35.480 --> 00:18:36.630
My bad.

00:18:36.630 --> 00:18:37.880
You forgot?!

00:18:38.130 --> 00:18:39.070
Um...

00:18:39.070 --> 00:18:42.590
I thought running errands 
for you <i>was</i> my training...

00:18:42.590 --> 00:18:43.430
Huh?

00:18:43.430 --> 00:18:46.460
How the hell would that be training? 
You were just my errand boy.

00:18:46.460 --> 00:18:47.900
That was really blunt!

00:18:48.210 --> 00:18:50.220
So it wasn't training?

00:18:50.220 --> 00:18:51.400
Upsy-daisy.

00:18:51.400 --> 00:18:54.960
Though, to be perfectly honest, 
there's really no point in training.

00:18:54.960 --> 00:18:55.770
Huh?!

00:18:58.790 --> 00:19:00.040
Don't come over here.

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:05.030
There's only one thing I can teach you.

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:09.050
You heard that I'm related to Robi, right?

00:19:09.600 --> 00:19:12.340
Robi's from a branch family, 
and I'm from the main family.

00:19:12.340 --> 00:19:14.370
We pretty much have the same abilities.

00:19:18.560 --> 00:19:22.040
My partner in crime is this uber, 
super, duper cute...

00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:25.900
baby.

00:19:26.300 --> 00:19:31.510
The Winged Devourer of Despair, 
Undead Archer Barbatos Bachiko.

00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:31.060
<b>The Winged Devourer of Despair (Undead Archer) Barbatos Bachiko</b>

00:19:31.510 --> 00:19:33.600
Hundred Bullseyes!

00:19:37.710 --> 00:19:40.480
Gotcha.

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:57.500
<b>Hundred</b>

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:57.500
<b>Bullseyes</b>

00:19:57.500 --> 00:20:01.700
So, with the Barbatos family 
bloodline ability, Hundred Bullseyes,

00:20:01.700 --> 00:20:03.310
as long as you can keep concentrating,

00:20:03.310 --> 00:20:06.770
you can continue shooting arrows 
that will hit their targets without fail.

00:20:07.040 --> 00:20:13.360
It's the evolved version of Robi's Bullseye Shot, 
which he can only use once a day.

00:20:14.320 --> 00:20:18.410
The only ones who can actually 
hit the mark 100% of the time

00:20:18.410 --> 00:20:21.650
are me, the chief, and the president.

00:20:21.650 --> 00:20:24.200
The chief and the president?

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:26.120
President Barbatos is one of

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:31.320
the Three Heroes of the Great War in 
Demon Valley, along with Furfur and Vepar.

00:20:31.320 --> 00:20:32.840
Heroes?

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:36.770
I've had plenty of demons come 
to me to learn how to shoot

00:20:36.770 --> 00:20:39.380
because they admire my Hundred Bullseyes.

00:20:39.640 --> 00:20:45.140
But demons naturally get bored easily, 
so they lack concentration and patience.

00:20:45.830 --> 00:20:48.360
Striking down any enemy, no matter how far,

00:20:48.360 --> 00:20:49.850
and helping their allies survive...

00:20:50.280 --> 00:20:51.760
People fear this weapon

00:20:51.760 --> 00:20:54.800
because a single archer can 
turn the battle around.

00:20:54.800 --> 00:20:59.240
If you manage to learn it, 
you'll advance far beyond Dalet, but...

00:21:00.150 --> 00:21:01.230
It's impossible.

00:21:01.640 --> 00:21:05.000
Demons just ain't cut out to use this.

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:09.940
Uh... What's with that face?

00:21:09.940 --> 00:21:11.960
Huh?! M-My face?

00:21:11.960 --> 00:21:13.410
Was there something weird about it?

00:21:13.410 --> 00:21:16.560
But, um... You were amazingly cool, Master!

00:21:16.560 --> 00:21:17.680
You were on fire!

00:21:18.320 --> 00:21:21.790
Are you really going to teach me 
that super cool thing?!

00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:26.430
W-Well, if you're willing to try, 
I'll help you out.

00:21:26.650 --> 00:21:27.960
Come on, let's go.

00:21:27.960 --> 00:21:28.680
Huh?

00:21:28.680 --> 00:21:33.360
I said we're gonna make your weapon, didn't I?

00:21:33.600 --> 00:21:36.230
Let's go? But where are we going?

00:21:37.410 --> 00:21:38.440
Here.

00:21:41.020 --> 00:21:43.150
Huh? What?

00:21:43.150 --> 00:21:45.150
But this is...

00:21:46.880 --> 00:21:51.030
This place is famous for making 
all kinds of insane things.

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:53.700
The Magical Apparatus Battler!

00:21:53.700 --> 00:21:56.040
U-Uh-huh...

00:23:26.920 --> 00:23:30.010
Su-Ki-Ma! Gotcha!

00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:30.170
<b>Su</b>

00:23:27.760 --> 00:23:30.170
<b>Ki</b>

00:23:28.510 --> 00:23:30.170
<b>Ma</b>

00:23:31.280 --> 00:23:32.760
Iruminati!

00:23:32.760 --> 00:23:34.010
Lindy!

00:23:34.430 --> 00:23:35.770
The two of us...

00:23:35.770 --> 00:23:38.020
are Master Bachiko's personal maids!

00:23:38.230 --> 00:23:39.770
Iru and Li!

00:23:38.230 --> 00:23:39.770
Li and Iru!

00:23:40.920 --> 00:23:44.250
Iruminati-chan, I'm pretty 
sure my name goes first.

00:23:44.250 --> 00:23:45.650
It should be Li and Iru.

00:23:45.840 --> 00:23:48.370
Lindy-chan, I should be first.

00:23:48.370 --> 00:23:49.810
It's Iru and Li.

00:23:49.810 --> 00:23:51.260
I won't compromise on this.

00:23:51.260 --> 00:23:53.440
Well, neither will I!

00:23:53.440 --> 00:23:54.680
Fine!

00:23:54.680 --> 00:23:56.740
Let's just see who happens to be...

00:23:58.290 --> 00:23:59.690
...the better maid!

00:24:00.120 --> 00:24:02.170
Who the hell cares?

00:24:03.000 --> 00:24:27.980
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:24:03.310 --> 00:24:05.700
Iruminati-chan sure is working hard.

00:24:05.700 --> 00:24:07.770
Lindy needs to do her best, too!

00:24:07.770 --> 00:24:10.170
No, wait! I need to do my best.

00:24:10.170 --> 00:24:13.380
If everyone other than me 
is able to make it to Dalet,

00:24:13.380 --> 00:24:15.260
I'm sure Robin-sensei will laugh at me.

00:24:15.750 --> 00:24:18.020
Next time on <i>Welcome to 
Demon School! Iruma-kun</i>,

00:24:18.020 --> 00:24:19.520
"Iruma's True Feelings."

00:24:19.520 --> 00:24:23.020
Huh? Iruma-kun? What's that in your hand?

00:24:23.020 --> 00:24:24.650
A new weapon?!

00:24:24.650 --> 00:24:26.090
Oh my gosh! That's so cool!

00:24:26.090 --> 00:24:27.990
You're lovely, Iruminati-chan!
